{"title": "Sword Coast", "pageid": 55384, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sword_Coast", "categories": ["Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg/300px-West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg/450px-West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg/600px-West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg/300px-West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"194\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/West_Faerun_Map_wotc.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>A map of western Faerûn</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>Sword Coast</b> is a region of <a href=\"/wiki/Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"Faerûn\">Faerûn</a>, generally accepted to span its western coastline from <a href=\"/wiki/Amn\" title=\"Amn\">Amn</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Waterdeep\" title=\"Waterdeep\">Waterdeep</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baldur's Gate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate\" title=\"Baldur's Gate\">Baldur's Gate</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Waterdeep\" title=\"Waterdeep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Waterdeep\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Waterdeep\" title=\"Waterdeep\">Waterdeep</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sword_Coast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sword Coast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"ext